/p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\">\\(A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall c\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;(H\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall c\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;(H\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeWeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeWeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeaklyCompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The partition relation is expanded: every two-coloring of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa]^2\">\\([\\kappa]^2\\)</span> has a homogeneous subset equinumerous with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-large-weakly-compact-cardinal</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-largecard2-weakly-compact-cardinal</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-largecard3-weakly-compact-cardinal</code>, and <code>58-df-weakly-compact-cardinal</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e1b64da99640200","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin